{"projectInfo":{"name":"IPv6 BGP 通过IPsec保护报文配置","path":"ipsec_ipv6_bgp","visibility":2,"categoryId":40,"introduction":"Router A、Router B和Router C三台路由器之间运行IPv6 BGP交互路由信息。Router A和Router B之间建立IBGP连接，Router B和Router C之间建立EBGP连接。为了提高安全性，配置通过IPsec对IPv6 BGP报文进行保护。","label":["BGP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}